<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For that which the law could not do, being weak,</l><l>In the flesh, God sending His Son,</l><l>In the likeness of flesh, and concerning sin,</l><l>He condemned sin in the flesh.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>That the righteous requirement of the law</l><l>Might be fulfilled in us,</l><l>Who do not walk according to the flesh of sin</l><l>But who walk according to the spirit.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>For those who are according to the flesh,</l><l>They all mind the things of the flesh;</l><l>But those who are according to the spirit,</l><l>Mind the things of the Spirit.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
